{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"隐私运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-discovery-classification","title":"数据发现与自动分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations/data-discovery-classification","wordCount":1928,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"consent-management-platform","title":"同意管理平台工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations/consent-management-platform","wordCount":1904,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-observability-incident","title":"隐私可观测性与事件响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations/privacy-observability-incident","wordCount":1992,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 隐私运维\n\n本章聚焦隐私工程的日常运维：如何在持续运行的系统中发现敏感数据、管理用户同意、监控隐私健康状态、以及在隐私事件发生时快速响应。\n\n隐私运维不是一次性的项目——它是贯穿系统生命周期的持续过程。数据发现与分类是一切的起点（你无法保护你不知道存在的数据），同意管理平台是用户意愿与系统行为之间的桥梁，隐私可观测性则让团队在问题升级为事件之前就能发现异常。三者协同构成隐私工程的运行时保障层。\n"}